  "description": "Transform your daily travel into an effortless and enjoyable journey with the Let's Commute eBike finished in a striking new blue colour. Designed for the modern urban rider, this eBike flawlessly blends sleek aesthetics with powerful electric assistance, ensuring you arrive at your destination refreshed and ready for the day. Its refined 6061 alloy frame features internal cable routing and discreetly integrated 36V 9.8Ah 352Wh battery, creating a clean, seamless look and optimal weight distribution.Experience smooth and consistent power from the responsive 250W (420W peak power) rear hub motor, effortlessly assisting you up inclines and across flats. All your ride information is clearly displayed on the Ananda D19 handlebar-mounted display with bluetooth technology and app compatibility. Gear changes are precise and intuitive with an L-TWOO 7-speed trigger shifter paired with a Shimano rear derailleur, allowing you to easily adapt to varying city terrains.A standout feature for confident urban riding is the powerful Tektro hydraulic disc brakes, now boasting 180mm rotors both front and rear for superior stopping power and control in all conditions. Rolling on wide 700x45c commuter tyres, this eBike offers enhanced stability and cushion, making light work of potholes and uneven surfaces.Every detail is crafted for your comfort and command. The oversized alloy riser bar (640mm) provides enhanced control and a relaxed, upright riding posture, complemented by comfortable rubber grips. An alloy stem adds to the bike's robust feel, while the plush city comfort saddle ensures a pleasant ride from start to finish. The Let's Commute eBike is your perfect partner for efficient, stylish, and enjoyable daily travel.",
